# The frontend does not need an API key.
# Configure GEMINI_API_KEY in backend/.env using backend/.env.example.
# Backend mail settings also belong in backend/.env: MAIL_PROVIDER, MAIL_FROM,
# and either RESEND_API_KEY (the default provider) or the SMTP_* settings.
# See docs/SMTP_SETUP.md. Never put mail credentials in VITE_ variables.
